SUMMARY:Spring Renewal: Sound Frequency Healing with Gongs & Vibrations
DESCRIPTION:🗓 Friday\, April 24\, 2026\n⏰ 7:00 – 8:30 PM\n📍 Inspire Wellness Collective | Lancaster\, PA\n💲 $20\n\nStep into a deeply immersive evening of sound\, stillness\, and renewal.\n\nJoin us for our April Sound Frequency Journey\, a restorative 90-minute experience designed to help you relax\, reset your nervous system\, and reconnect with your inner calm.\n\nLed by multi-instrumental sound practitioner Ryan Bright\, this session weaves together:\n✨ Gong bath meditation\n✨ Harmonic sound therapy\n✨ Vocal toning\n✨ Elemental healing frequencies\n\nWhether you’re brand new to sound healing or looking to support an ongoing wellness practice\, this experience offers a welcoming space to unwind\, release stress\, and restore balance.\n\n🧘‍♀️ No experience needed — just bring yourself\n(Feel free to bring a blanket and water for extra comfort)\n\n🌿 Come rest\, reset\, and renew.\n\n🎟 Reserve your spot today \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/spring-renewal-sound-frequency-healing-with-gongs-vibrations/
LOCATION:Inspire Wellness Collective\, 226 N. Arch Street\, Lancaster\, 17603
CATEGORIES:Health & Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/04/Red-and-White-Modern-Meet-Our-New-Team-LinkedIn-Post-1.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Inspire Wellness Collective":MAILTO:hello@inspirewellco.com
END:VEVENT
