SUMMARY:Picnic & Plant Story Hour at Perfect Pots Greenhouse
DESCRIPTION:We’re hosting a fun spring event just for the little gardeners in your life at our Strasburg Greenhouse! Join us for a morning story time of plant exploration\, where they’ll embark on a journey of discovery\, learning\, and hands-on fun.\n\nActivities Include:\nPlant-Themed Storytime\n\nSettle in on our picnic blanket as we read a plant based story together! By engaging with tales of plant life\, we’ll spark curiosity and foster a deeper appreciation for the natural world.\n\n– Hands-On Exploration – \nWith plants from our own greenhouse\, your children will engage their senses to connect with nature firsthand. From velvety leaves to fragrant blooms\, they’ll have the opportunity to touch\, smell\, and observe a diverse array of plants related to our story. \n\n– Choose Your Own Plant –\nEach child will select a special plant companion from our picnic blanket to take home\, continuing to inspire a love for gardening and stewardship of the environment. \n\n– Snack Box for Kids –\nIt wouldn’t be a picnic without snacks! Our little gardeners will receive a delightful assortment of snacks\, provided by Speckled Hen\, in their own snack box.\n\n– Coffee and Beverages for Adults –\nEnjoy a complimentary Coffee or Hot Beverage\, thanks to our story-time partners at Speckled Hen. \n\nTickets are $25 for 1 supervising adult and 1 little gardener. Please purchase additional tickets for any additional children to ensure everyone receives their own snack and plant. \n\nBest for kids aged 2-7\n\nSpaces are limited\, so reserve your spot on the picnic blanket today! \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/picnic-plant-story-hour-at-perfect-pots-greenhouse-2/
LOCATION:Perfect Pots Greenhouse\, 745 Strasburg Pike\, Strasburg\, PA\, 17579\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/03/28.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Perfect Pots":MAILTO:marketing@perfectpots.com
END:VEVENT
