SUMMARY:Trinity First Friday Speaker Series
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Trinity Lutheran Church\, 31 S. Duke Street on Friday\, May 1st for a Trinity First Friday Speaker Series event. The evening will begin at 5 pm with the playing of the Church bells and a short organ demonstration. The main speaker presentation will start at 5:30 pm followed by sanctuary tours and refreshments. All activities will be held in the Church Sanctuary at the corner of Duke and Mifflin Streets. The speakers will be Christina McSherry and Pam Stoner presenting on the Lancaster City Witness Stones Project. Christina and Pam are with Historic Rockford. Free parking is provided. \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/trinity-first-friday-speaker-series/
